{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8427289b9ecf1955","name":"Overland Travel","source":{"id":"source:reference-8427289b9ecf1955","title":"Overland Travel","revision":21226,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:23:36Z","sha256":"d7e62ae394e448b2efd650efbf784aa6cbdb695dd42eb98547314630f1a11248","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21226","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Overland%20Travel&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8427289b9ecf1955","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"}," represents traveling across a dangerous expanse of wilderness. It can be used in a variety of environments, including the deserts of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tatooine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tatooine","referenceId":"reference:a1b911e88e4876e1"}," and the jungles of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Felucia"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Felucia","referenceId":"reference:250a80750f084438"},". Higher-level versions of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"}," could work in environments that are even more hazardous, such as the toxic surface of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dorin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dorin","referenceId":"reference:4331a79784e79b6d"}," or the volcanic wastes of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mustafar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mustafar","referenceId":"reference:1233775240ba356a"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Overland Travel Statistics (CL 4)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Complexity:"]}," 3 (3 Successes per hero before there are no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," DCs below DC 34)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested Primary Skills for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Endurance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endurance","referenceId":"reference:98c8abf84e23ff3f"}," (DC 16):"]}," The heroes can attempt to push on even when fatigued, using less water and fewer supplies, and shortening their trip by setting a more brisk pace."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Life Sciences)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Life_Sciences)"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Physical Sciences)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Physical_Sciences)"}," (DC 16):"]}," The heroes can identify hazards and dangerous wildlife, avoiding potential threats to their safety."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," (DC 21):"]}," The heroes can try to plot a course by identifying major landmarks and using those sights to make sure that they remain on the correct path."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"}," (DC 16):"]}," The heroes can attempt to find safe trails and scavenge for more supplies to ease the burden on their resources."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," (DC 21):"]}," The heroes can try to treat each others' fatigue and injuries, ensuring that they continue on at a good pace across the dangerous land."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Challenge Effects"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Challenge Effects"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Challenge_Effects"}," for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Degenerating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Degenerating","referenceId":"reference:e00c863b89f2b4c6"},":"]}," This Skill Challenge does not end when the heroes accrue three Failures. Instead, the general difficulty category for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," increases by one step for each Failure accrued.\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["Each Failure increases the difficulty of all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," uses by one step (from DC 16 to DC 21, from DC 21 to DC 26, from DC 26 to DC 29, and from DC 29 to DC 34). Each Success reduces the difficulty of all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," uses by one step, but no further than the original DC of each ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"},"."]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Extreme Success"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Extreme_Success","referenceId":"reference:bb5a69f0ddc5d175"},":"]}," A hero who succeeds on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," by 10 or more earns two Successes instead of one."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Individual Effort"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Individual_Effort","referenceId":"reference:254b52a23bdff359"},":"]}," Each hero must earn three Successes to complete the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},"."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Success and Failure"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Success:"]}," The heroes reach their destination safely.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Failure:"]}," If the heroes accrue enough Failures to shift all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," DCs to 34, they fail the challenge and become lost in the wilderness. Each hero also loses one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Second Wind"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Second_Wind"}," and gains a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"}," that can be removed only by eight hours of rest in a civilized area. As long as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"}," remains, the heroes lose one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Second Wind"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Second_Wind"}," each day.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
